* ELM2021 Vize Ornegi 4: Zener Diyot Regulator ve Yuk Direnci Tarama
* Boylestad Ornek 2.26: Vi=16V, Rs=1k, Vz=10V, Pzm=300mW
* Beklenen El Hesabi:
*   RL(min) = 1666.7 Ohm -> RL=1.2k iken Zener OFF (VL=8.73V)
*   RL=3k iken Zener ON (VL=10V, Iz=2.67mA)

.model DZ_10V D(BV=10 IBV=1m Rs=0.001)

Vi in 0 DC 16
Rs in vl 1k
* Zener ters kutuplanir (anot 0'da, katot vl'de)
Dz 0 vl DZ_10V
RL vl 0 3k

.control
  op
  print v(vl) i(RL)
  dc RL 500 5000 50
  plot v(vl) title 'Yuk Direncine Gore Regule Cikis VL'
.endc

.end

